
### 회원가입
POST https://panda-market-api.vercel.app/auth/signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "qwerqwer@email.com",
  "nickname": "qwerqwer",
  "password": "qwer1234",
  "passwordConfirmation": "qwer1234"
}

### 로그인

POST  https://panda-market-api.vercel.app/auth/signIn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "qwerqwer@email.com",
  "password": "qwer1234"
}